{"id":"00019","root":"uni00019_1","name":{"ja":"セラステス","en":"Cerastes"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"セラステス","en":"Cerastes"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":19,"profile":{"ja":"高位魔族。上半身は人、下半身は大蛇の姿でナーガ族と呼ばれる蛇神の一族。人間界で傭兵業を営む。常に死が伴う傭兵稼業を天職と考えている戦闘狂。人間界で生まれ、人に育てられたためナーガ族である自覚はない。ある魔科医から購入した人に化けられる仮面によって人間の姿となって行動しているが戦闘時は本当の姿で戦う。本来、ナーガ族は自らの力で人に化ける事が出来るが、人に育てられたセラステスはその方法が分からないため仮面の力に頼っている。幼い時から蛇人間として蔑まされてきたトラウマからか、人間に強い敵愾心を持っており特にお高く止まっている者や、正義を振りまく対魔忍は嫌悪の象徴。カリヤという名の同族の戦士が人間界にいるいう噂を聞きつけ、彼女を探す旅の中でふうま小太郎に会う。","en":"(Cerastes, she/her) Cerastes is a high-rank demon whose upper body is human and lower body that of a massive serpent, belonging to the naga clan of snake deities. She works as a mercenary in the Human Realm and views the ever-present death of mercenary life as her true calling. Born and raised by humans, she lacks awareness of her naga heritage. She disguises herself as a human using a mask purchased from a demon scientist, but reverts to her true form in battle. While nagas can normally shapeshift at will, Cerastes, having been raised by humans, cannot and thus relies on the mask's power. Traumatized from childhood contempt as a snake-human, she harbors strong hostility toward humans, especially the lofty and the justice-spreading Taimanin, whom she despises. Hearing rumors of a fellow naga warrior named Kaliya in the Human Realm, she meets Fuuma Kotaro while searching for her."},"illustrator":"みこやん","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00019_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[964,1928],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[138,276],"def":[118,236],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","57"]},{"id":"uni00019_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1428,2856],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[211,422],"def":[171,342],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","57","58"]},{"id":"uni00019_3","rarity":5,"rari