,3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「あたいの名はセラステス。流れの傭兵さ。キッチリ払ってくれりゃ、いくらでも暴れてやるぜ！」","en":"My name's Cerastes. I'm a mercenary of the currents. Pay me properly and I'll go on a rampage as much as you want!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"……あぁン？　なんだテメェ。やる気か？","en":"…Huh? What the hell are you? Got some fight in you?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"へへっ。あたいのこと、もっと頼ってもいいんだぜ？","en":"Heh. You can rely on me even more, you know?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"なあ、早く戦いに連れてってくれよ？　ヒマ過ぎて、身体がなまっちまいそうだ","en":"Hey, take me into battle already, will ya? I'm so bored I'm about to get all flabby."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"お、オイ。あたいに、なにを期待してんのさ！？","en":"Hey, you. What the hell are you expecting from me!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"んだよ？　あたいの身体ばっか、ジロジロ見るなってんだよ。……い、いいけど、さぁ。別に","en":"What? Stop staring at my body all the time. …Fine, whatever."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"へっ。笑わせるな。あたいのこのフルパワー、受けてみるってのかい？","en":"Heh. Don't make me laugh. You wanna feel my full power, huh?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"面白いコトを言うねぇ。いいぜ。あたいが試してやらあ。歯ぁ食いしばりなッ！！","en":"Interesting thing you say. Fine. I'll give you a taste. Grit your teeth!!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00019_1/uni00019_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","ind